<title>LEBANON: Lebanon  killer executed by hanging.</title>
<headline>Lebanon  killer executed by hanging.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Lebanese man convicted of killing two citizens was executed by hanging early on Monday, judicial sources said.</p>
<p>They said 32-year-old Mohammad Kour, sentenced to death in January by a civil court, was executed at Roumyeh jail in mountains northeast of Beirut.</p>
<p>It was the eighth execution in Lebanon since the 1975-1990 civil war.</p>
</text>
